      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "VRChat really should seriously reconsider their domain policy.\n\nThe vast majority of people using proton domains use it to strengthen the privacy and security of their personal information, especially compared to providers like Gmail, Outlook, Yahoo, etc.\n\nIf they should reconsider, i would also like to kindly ask to add support for SimpleLogin/Protonmail's hide-my-email domains.\n\nWhile i do fully understand that some people will inevitably abuse this to circumvent account bans, i truly believe that it would be a net positive for the vast majority of users. Especially at a time like now when data breaches are only a question of when, not if.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
